window.products.push({"id":897011,"name":"Windowsandgarden Cordless Top Down Bottom Up Woven Wood Shades, 18 3/8\"-24\" Wide x 36\"-48\" High, Bayhead Natural","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":86.27,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Wh5ByJ+mL._AC_.jpg","description":"Natural top down bottom up woven wood shades have a unique dual cordless mechanism that eliminates lift cords. To operate the shade simply push the bottom rail or middle rail upward or pull downward to the position you desire. Our natural woven wood shades are made of bamboo and other natural materials, which are woven on hand fed looms. Kiln drying minimizes warping or the natural material. Shades lift evenly and stack into neat folds. 6 inch valance conceals operating mechanism. Your woven wood shades are made of natural materials harvested from nature. Each harvest of natural fibers is unique and will have slight variations in color, grain, texture, striations and warping. As a result of these inherent qualities, no two shades are identical nor can they be. All mounting hardware included. We can customize these cordless top down bottom up woven wood shades up to an 1/8th inch. Once you click your size and color you will see a \"Customize Now\" button on the top right. Then type inside the window frame mount or outside the window frame mount and your exact measurements to the 1/8th of an inch. Order slightly larger sizes in the drop down. For example, if you need 24 1/2w x 48 1/2h order the 25w x 52h size in the drop down and then customize if from there. Outside mount we take no deductions. Give us the exact size you want for an outside mount. Inside mount we take a 3/8 inch deduction of the exact opening measuring to the 1/8th inch. Minimum depth required for an inside mount is 2 inches at the top. Flush mount is 2 1/2 inches. Widths 18-72 wide and height 48-72 high. We cannot do heights under 48 inches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Wh5ByJ+mL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Windowsandgarden","source_asin":"B08K61X7WC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-897011","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K61X7WC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K61X7WC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
