window.products.push({"id":897123,"name":"Mejoroom Queen Size Sheet Set - Hotel Luxury 1800 Bedding Sheets & Pillowcases - Deep Pocket Fitted Sheet, Hypoallergenic, Wrinkle& Breathable, Fade R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PQLJH2ZbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mejoroom Queen Sheet Set - HIGH QUALITY 100% Brushed Microfiber 1800 Bedding Collections.Ultimate blend of craftsmanship and elegance, our linens are designed to offer you a unique and sophisticated sleeping experience Benefits Microfibers are the newest bedding fabric and is distinctive for its unique thinness and strength. These fibers are even thinner than most luxurious natural fibers such as silk. Woven tightly, it provides extra strength and durability. This fabric has desirable properties such as breathing ability, wrinkle resistance, luxurious appearance and easy cleaning. Microfiber sheets are also the best choices for allergy sufferers and can help you rest better. In addition it considered environmentally friendly as opposed to cotton. Easy to Care for 1.Ordinary washers and dryers can be used for easy care and washing of this set. Hand or machine wash in cold or warm water with mild detergent is recommended.2.Air dry is best for drying since microfiber dries relatively quickly. However, if you plan to use the dryer, set it on low heat or no heat. This setting uses less quantity of water for laundering, less percentage of chemicals and consume less energy for drying. Besides this, it is preshrunk to avoid any shrinkage after washing. All Specifications Queen: 1 Flat (92\"\" x 102\"\") 1 Fitted (60\"\" x 80\"\") and 2 Std Pillow Cases (20\"\" x 30\"\"). King: 1 Flat (102\"\"x105\"\") 1 Fitted (78\"\"x80\"\") and 2 Std Pillow Cases (20\"\"x40\"\"). Cal King: 1 Flat (108\"\"x102\"\") 1 Fitted (72\"\"x84\"\") and 2 Std Pillow Cases (20\"\"x40\"\"). Full: 1 Flat (81\"\"x96\"\") 1 Fitted (54\"\"x75\"\") and 2 Std Pillow Cases (20\"\"x30\"\") 100% Satisfaction Guaranteed At our sheet set and More, we guarantee your 100% satisfaction! If within 30 days you are not 100% satisfied return your product for a full refund! NO QUESTIONS ASKED!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PQLJH2ZbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mejoroom","source_asin":"B08LYGR93X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-897123","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LYGR93X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LYGR93X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
