window.products.push({"id":897171,"name":"Snowfox Insulated Stainless Steel Cocktail Glass/Drink Tumbler, 14.5-ounce, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51eZuAmEMBL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Performance + Good Looks: Don’t let the modern sleek profile fool you: this insulated drink container’s strong interior holds 14.5 oz of tasty cold beverage, making it a good choice for a classic highball, beer with foam, or an XL hard lemonade on a hot day. Whether you’re serving pals at a beach cookout or relaxing at home, grab a tumbler then sip and enjoy. Sturdy On-The-Go Drinkware: Superior stainless steel barware never goes out of style and offers plenty of lasting advantages. Enjoy your new insulated tumblers for regular beverages anytime, and pack them to take along on vacations, camping trips, and special events where you want the conversations to heat up but not the cocktails. Have fun, chill out, and savor great flavor.. Moisture-Free Built-In Coaster: Our double-walled metal glasses are always vacuum-insulated, helping them stand apart from other steel tumblers on the market. The food-grade layers hold strong through years of use, ensuring the outside won’t slip or drip, while drinks remain fresh and temperature-controlled inside. Cheers! Gorgeous Gift Set: Wrap up a set of Premium Stainless Steel Cocktail Glasses as a treasured gift for weddings, birthdays, holidays, business clients, and housewarmings. These unique insulated drink tumblers impress recipients with every pour and sip. They’re sure to toast your generosity. Shine On In Style With SNOWFOX: Liven up home parties or take it on the road with top-quality cocktail making accessories like our stunning steel drink glasses, tumblers, shakers, and ice buckets. Rely on the beverage experts at SNOWFOX to deliver the modern looks and durability that you and your guests deserve.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51eZuAmEMBL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Snowfox","source_asin":"B07YQPHSCY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-897171","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YQPHSCY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YQPHSCY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
