window.products.push({"id":897175,"name":"Soothing Company Baby Bath Pillow, Baby Newborn Essential, Baby Bath Cushion, Soft Easy to Dry, Baby Bath Flower for Bathtub or Sink, Baby Bath Sink P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512hkIsEITL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quick Drying - Our Baby Bath Sponge Mat features premium three-dimensional air mesh fabric ventilation, which is a special type of warp-knitted spacer fabric whose outer layers are meshed and allows the baby bathtub pillow to dry quickly between each bath time. The durable plastic hook allows you to store the baby bath sponge cushion when you are finished using it and can also speed up the drying process. Fits Perfectly In Most Sinks - Make your baby bath time safer, happier and more comfortable experience. This Flower Bath Mat for babies conforms to most kitchen and bathroom sinks to cradle and protect the newborn from cool and hard edges of the sink. It has flexible petals that curves towards each other filling gaps and fits snugly against any size of sink or tub. The suction cup helps the baby bath tub pillow to not slide around when you are bathing your baby. Travel Friendly - No more worries when planning to travel with the whole family including your infant or newborn baby. You can use this baby bath pad on a hotel bathroom sink to save your back since you can’t bring a baby bathtub for travel. Bath flowers are easy to carry because it includes a high quality elegant bag for storage or travelling that secures both baby tub cushion and washing machine bag. This baby bath flower sink insert is a must! Better Than A Plastic Tub - Let your baby enjoy their bath time when they are laying on top of this baby bath sink pad. No hard plastic against their backs and optimal neck and back support. Baby sink bath is safer even for the most delicate skin because the fabric is soft, plush and very gentle against your baby's skin. No need to stress about the harmful particles with Soothing Company's baby bath sponge support because it comes with a washing machine friendly cover making it easy to maintain. Perfect Baby Gift - Looking for a perfect gift for expecting mothers? Friends with newborn baby / infants or even for your own precious baby? We'll make sure that this baby bath sink insert accessory will make them feel special and loved. Our baby flower bath is designed for you and your baby's comfort in mind with its soft foam material that dries quickly and feels great to the touch. It has a simple yet adorable design which can help to keep the baby engaged and happy during bathing time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512hkIsEITL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Soothing Company","source_asin":"B09SP7YJ46","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-897175","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SP7YJ46","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SP7YJ46","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
