window.products.push({"id":897192,"name":"Zak Designs, Inc. Frozen 2 Stainless Steel Bottle for Kids - Disney Frozen Kids Insulated Water Bottle with Push Button Spout, Perfect Frozen 2 Water ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+0GR5rE+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Keep your kids fresh and hydrated with this amazing Frozen 2 kids water bottle with straw spout. Complete their Disney Frozen school supplies collection with this cool-looking metal water bottle kids will carry with them anywhere they go. The Frozen 2 water bottle for girls and boys is ideal for avoiding spills in moving cars or when walking, and will make a great gift for kids of any age. Kids will love to stay hydrated outdoors having the Disney Frozen kids stainless steel water bottle to drink from anytime they're thirsty. Whether at home or traveling in the car, the spout is accessible and easy-to-open thanks to its convenient button. Boys and girls who love Frozen Princesses Anna and Elsa will love to drink from this colorful kids thermal water bottle. Drink in style with Frozen 2 insulated water bottle for school. Featuring cool graphics of Frozen 2, the thermos for kids is convenient for your little ones to stay hydrated at school or while traveling. Push the button spout that allows for easy opening and closing without making a mess. Perfect Frozen 2 kids bottle to carry with them and bring on-the-go anywhere they go. The Frozen 2 thermos kids water bottle is made with high-quality, resistant, durable and child-safe materials meant to last for a long time without damaging or leaking when used properly. The kids water bottle thermos cup is made with stainless steel designed to keep water and drinks fresh at all times, and includes an easy-to-open push button spout for mess-free drinking at all times. Includes 1 Frozen 2 Stainless Steel water bottle kids will love for school, field trips, and picnic days. Push the button and drink from the spout! Frozen kids insulated water bottles are perfect for fans of the adorable Disney Princesses. Features a colorful silver and blue design and lovely graphics of Trust Your Journey. The child water bottle can hold up to 15.5 fluid ounces.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+0GR5rE+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zak Designs","source_asin":"B09XR35KJL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-897192","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XR35KJL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XR35KJL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
