window.products.push({"id":897207,"name":"Tufted High Arch Headboard in Parchment Size: King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31oIQEo+AZL._AC_.jpg","description":"863(Parchment) Size: King This beautifully hand-crafted headboard adds style to any bedroom. The high back, tufted grooves and sophisticated styling are truly fit for a King or Queen. With its pine wood frame and thick luxurious foam padding the bedtime reading may last a little longer. Easy assembly is required. Features: -Metal legs -Pine wood frame -43pct Poly / 57pct Cotton -Luxurious Shantung Silk-like Upholstery -Foam constructed out of polyurethane foam cotton -Headboards attach to a standard bed frame using the provided metal legs -Adjustable up to 56'' H with the legs attached, the headboards without the legs are 28'' tall -Note: Full/Queen headboard will accommodate a full bed frame but the headboard will extend 3'' on both sides of the frame Specifications: -Twin Dimensions: 60'' H x 42'' W x 4'' D -Full/Queen Dimensions: 61'' H x 61'' W x 4'' D -King Dimensions: 61'' H x 79'' W x 4'' D Cleaning Codes -Premier & Bokhara (WS) To prevent overall soil, frequent vacuuming or light brushing to remove dust and grime is recommended. Spot clean, with a mild solvent, an upholstery shampoo, or the foam from a mild detergent. When using a solvent or dry cleaning product, follow instructions carefully and clean only in a well ventilated room. Avoid any product which is highly toxic. With either method, pretest a small area before proceeding. Use a professional furniture cleaning service when an overall soiled condition has been reached. -Shantung and Leather (S) To prevent overall soil, frequent vacuuming or light brushing to remove dust and grime is recommended. Spot clean using a mild water-free solvent or dry cleaning product. Clean only in a well ventilated room and avoid any product containing carbon tetrachloride which is highly toxic. Pretest small area before proceeding. Cleaning by a professional furniture cleaning service only is recommended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31oIQEo+AZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Skyline Furniture","source_asin":"B001ODB3BM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-897207","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001ODB3BM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001ODB3BM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
