window.products.push({"id":897210,"name":"Sewing Pattern Laughing Moon 120 - LM 120 : 1840’s / 1860’s Pleated Wrapper, Morning Gown, Work or Maternity Dress","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81e5wPcmMyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sewing Pattern - 1840s—1860 Ladies’ Pleated Wrapper, Morning Dress, Work Dress and Maternity Dress with pleated bishop or pagoda sleeve, with or without standing collar. Sizes 6 - 34, All in the Envelope. This dress has a dropped shoulder typical of the time period. It falls freely from the bottoms of the yokes, with no fitted lining underneath. The dress is shown pleated to the yokes but can be gathered instead. View A is a bishop sleeved wrapper with a standing collar. View B has a small pagoda sleeves with a piped jewel neckline. Both views can have the pleats stitched down at the waist or left loose, and the waist can be confined with a belt. Both have piping at the armholes, across the bottom of the yokes, and View B has a piped neckline. The front opening can be left open from top to bottom using closures of buttons or hooks and eyes, or stitched closed from below the waist to the hem, using closures from the neck to the top of the stitching. An optional pocket is included. Fabric: Cotton calico, cotton chintz, cotton broadcloth, wool broadcloth, wool challis, wool crepe, silk taffeta. Lining: Self or any kind of cotton—most wrappers seem to have been lined with scrap fabrics. Belt Interfacing: Any stiff fabric Notions: Both views - 8, 1/2” buttons or 14 hooks and eyes, many more will be required if the dress buttons all the way to the hem. Fine cotton cooking twine or cotton knitting yarn for the piping. This dress was copied from a existing wrapper example dated 1840. This style would have been worn from the 1840s to 1860s. This type of dress was called different names according it’s purpose. It is a morning dress, or wrapper, meant for informal wear.at home. If it is made with finer more expensive materials it is a gown suitable for a wider range of occasions, including receiving visitors at home. If it is finished plain, it can also be called a work dress. Worn loose for maternity. This dress is perfect for impressions of rural or frontier life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81e5wPcmMyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Laughing Moon Mercantile","source_asin":"B00DX2ZP52","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-897210","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DX2ZP52","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DX2ZP52","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":897211,"name":"Yamazaki Cable 10-Piece Place Setting Silverware 18/8 Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51O0gvLzvjL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Yamazaki Cable 10-Piece Place Setting Silverware 18/8 Stainless Steel is Scandinavian inspired for today's table. The 10-piece place setting includes: 2 dinner knives, 2 dinner forks, 2 salad/dessert forks, 2 soup/cereal spoons, and 2 teaspoons. For nearly 100 years, Yamazaki has been recognized as one of the most respected manufacturers of fine stainless steel flatware, serve ware, gift and housewares. Yamazaki has been a family owned organization and has been instrumental in the popularity of Japanese flatware worldwide. Yamazaki is known for original patterns, innovative designs and manufacturing techniques, high quality materials and attention to detail. Details: Includes 2 teaspoon, 2 soup spoon, 2 dinner knives, 2 dinner forks and 2 salad forks. 10-piece cable place settings. 18/8 stainless steel. Dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51O0gvLzvjL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yamazaki","source_asin":"B081D88154","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-897211","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081D88154","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081D88154","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
