window.products.push({"id":897296,"name":"DECOMEN Halloween Pumpkin Carving Tools Kit, Halloween Jack-O-Lanterns 12 Piece Professional Pumpkin Cutting Supplies Tools Kit With 2 LED Candles & H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aWt3NS-vL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Carving pumpkins with your family and friends is a tradition that will leave everyone with lifelong memories of those moments. Those moments shouldn’t be spoiled by faulty pumpkin carving tools. That's why we specially designed this stainless steel 11-piece pumpkin carving kit that includes everything you need for your Jack-o-Lantern masterpiece! Product description： Feature: 1)Pumpkin engraving pen : Punch holes in the pumpkin,designing engrave different you want patterns. 2)Single side serrated saw: Used to cut different types of precise and complex detail patterns. 3) Double-sided Serrated Saw: Cut the lid of the pumpkin and engrave the simple design.Heavy-duty serrated engraving machine cutting pattern trimming edges and engraving details. 4) Pumpkin scoop :Clean inside of the pumpkin,make it clean and convenient carving. 5) Pumpkin scraper: Use to punch holes or circles. Pattern shifting and fine detailing. 6) 6 sculpting, cutting and carving tools: Great for shaping details of the design.Make expressive life like pumpkin character designs by using the tools to cutout and create realistic 3 dimensional facial details like hair,teeth,nose and eyes. 6) 2 LED pumpkin candles, 2m hemp rope and 6 bonus paper stencils make your pumpkin more realistic PACKAGE INCLUDE： 1 x double-side saw 1 X Single side serrated saw 1 x Pumpkin scoop 1 x Pumpkin engraving pen 1 x Pumpkin scraper 6 x double-sided stainless steel detail sculpting 1 x Zipper storage handbag 2 x LED pumpkin candles 1 x 2m hemp rope 6 x bonus paper stencils Notice: 1.Adult supervision is required when tools are in use,Not recommended for children under 9. 2.When not in use, store out of children's reach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aWt3NS-vL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DECOMEN","source_asin":"B08CZQCNZ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-897296","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CZQCNZ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CZQCNZ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
