window.products.push({"id":897396,"name":"Vermon Meat Thermometer Upgraded Replacement Probe 2 Pack, Ultra Accurate & Fast Meat Temperature Probe for Smoker, BBQ, Kitchen Cooking Food, Oven (2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ak+mIYnCS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Meat Thermometer Probe Replacement Temperature Probe Upgraded Features: 1. 6\" probe with non-slip design 2. easier to push in or pull out 3. heat resistant material help to prolong service life Please Note: 1. Do not immerse the probe wire or the housing in water, this could cause the probe to short out. It's okay to immerse the probe itself in water. 2. Clean and dry the probe thoroughly after each use with a damp cloth. 3. Always insert your probe in the thickest parts of the meat while avoiding fatty or boney areas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ak+mIYnCS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vermon","source_asin":"B0912DBG6R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-897396","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0912DBG6R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0912DBG6R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":897397,"name":"Dylan Kendall Home Rabbit 4 Piece Kids Plate Set, Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61noqnpE93L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"The Dylan Kendall 4-Piece Kids Tabletop Set featuring our Lighthearted Rabbit symbolizes the abundance of life! This tabletop set includes one each: 10\" Dinner Plate; 8\" Lunch Plate; 3.5\" diameter 8-ounce cup and a 5.5\" diameter bowl. Dishes are durable, multi-use and dishwasher safe. Do not microwave as organic, plant-based dishes may warp! BPA and phthalates free. Our Lighthearted Rabbit symbolizes the abundance of life! As the seasons change, the rabbit springs forth, bouncing through life. The rabbit is seen as a symbol of good luck, hope and new opportunities. Remember raising rabbits is a commitment. Rabbits are not Easter presents to be abandoned weeks after the holiday. Adopt a bunny and make a life-long friend! What makes these dishes eco? We made these dishes to give families a safer choice both for their kids and for the planet. Our eco dishes are made from a blend of bamboo and corn and have less than a teaspoon of melamine in them. These dishes will never expose your children to toxic chemicals and are as safe as eating on a leaf. As importantly, most kids' dishes in the market are not recyclable and end up polluting the oceans where they break into tiny particulates which get consumed by birds and sea animals. Our eco dishes are biodegradable and ocean-safe, they will dissolve. Everything from the durable bioplastic material to the dyes to the glossy coating is plant-based. We believe we should protect our kids from more chemical exposure and protect the planet so that they, and all the animals who share the Earth with us, can enjoy the natural environment for generations to come. Drawings by Martin León Barreto for Dylan Kendall. Use with Love.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61noqnpE93L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"dylan kendall","source_asin":"B0747X6K37","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-897397","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0747X6K37","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0747X6K37","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
