window.products.push({"id":897406,"name":"COVASA Hand Towels for Bathroom,Firefighters Firemen Fire,Microfiber Soft Highly Absorbent Face Towel Decor Gifts Portable Small Towels Washcloths for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7124-hHxBBS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our extra long hand towels are made of 100% superfine fiber, eco-friendly and synthetic materials, safe for you and your family. Highly absorbent soft hand towel, quick drying, lightweight.  Towel size is 15.7 x 27.5 inch, not too thin or too thick towel, durable and fluffy. This is also a perfect gift for your loved one, housewarming gift, holiday gift any occasion.  Unique Design: Our towels are single-sided printing. One side is a pattern, the other side is white fluff. Ideal for home, kitchen,bathroom ,office, gym, hotel, outdoor and travel use.  Package Include: 1 x hand towel;  Washing Instructions: Always clean the new towel before using it for the first time. Machine washing or hand washing, tumble dry on low. Do not use bleach and iron.  ✦ Note: 1.Due to manual measurement, please kindly allow 1-2 cm discrepancy.; 2.Pictures are taken by pro photographer,please understand the differences caused by lighting effects and monitor's brightness/contrast settings etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7124-hHxBBS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COVASA","source_asin":"B0948H1WS3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-897406","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0948H1WS3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0948H1WS3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":897407,"name":"Silicone Lids 8 Pack, Stretchable, Reusable, Durable Kitchen Gadget, Dishwasher and Freezer Safe, Preserve Food (Clear/White, Normal Pack/Circular)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MCCLdBKGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stretchable Silicone Lids (8 Pack) by Delightful Premium These smart reusable lids can stretch over all kind of round shapes. The lids are very hard to tear apart. Well, you can if you want to, but you really have to be determined then to do that. :)   Not only can these fit a wide range of containers, they also work on objects that didn't even had a lid to begin with! These lids can also replace lost lids.   Also, I personally love these when juicing as I can cut, say, a pineapple or a watermelon in half, put this lid on, and use that half later, fresh from the fridge. Won't last forever naturally, but it will keep it fresh longer, and not let it dry out.    The 6 different diameter sizes are:  2.56in / 6.5cm  3.74in / 9.5cm  4.53in / 11.5cm  5.71in / 14.5cm  6.50in / 16.5cm  8.27in / 21cm  They stretch to the next lid size, covering you in a long range of sizes you would ever need. The inner side wall of the lid is about 1.02in/2.7cm in height which is handy to cover objects that need that extra length because the diameter of the object is larger. Bonus: You will get:  One extra 2.56in / 6.5cm lid  One extra 3.74in / 9.5cm lid Tips: These, or the surface you put these on, should be dry. Otherwise you will have a hard time to put them on, because they will slip. If surface is rugged it would be a bit easier even if surface is wet however. Such as a pineapple.  These lids can also work to keep any liquid from spilling out.  If you happen to get less than 8 lids, the supplier made a mistake when packing, so message us and we can sort it out. Note: These currently come in a poly bag. We include a insert so you can see it's a genuine Delightful Premium product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MCCLdBKGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AZMRV","source_asin":"B0130KYN4U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-897407","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0130KYN4U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0130KYN4U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
