window.products.push({"id":897986,"name":"Elegant Hammered Glass Beverage Dispenser with Scroll Iron Stand - 2.25 Gallon - Stainless Steel Leak Free Spigot Included - Home Bar & Party Vintage ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811P1-xph8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for that perfect wedding centerpiece or gift? Looking to enhance your home bar? Look no farther! This elegant square design beverage dispenser was designed with you in mind. Constructed of durable hammered glass, that gives any drink an upscale look. Its glass cover ensures freshness to your drink while keeping it clean and sterile. This drink dispenser fills a large capacity of 2.25 gallon leaving you free to enjoy your guest and family, instead of the constant burden of serving and refilling drinks. Sits on a beautiful antique looking white wrought iron stand in a scroll like design that will blend in well to any table top décor giving it that special flair. This makes the perfect centerpiece for any occasion. This is very popular at wedding receptions and engagement parties. Use it at your next Holiday and Family dinner, Thanksgiving dinner you host. Place it on your kitchen counter and watch the way an ordinary drink turns into a festival. Bring up the notch to your home bar with this elegant, fine design drink dispenser. Breaking your head finding the perfect gift for a loved one, a neighbor or close friend, something useful and nice? This fits the bill just right, be it for a birthday, an anniversary, Valentine’s Day or just because, your benefactor will surely be thanking you time and time again. Lastly, don’t be fooled by the plastic spigot! Our dispenser comes with a stainless steel spigot, a leak free and lead free pouring spout that will ensure no leaking and a mess free and clean table. So, if you are buying this for yourself or for someone you love, you made the right choice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811P1-xph8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RPI","source_asin":"B01AS9A1A6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-897986","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AS9A1A6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AS9A1A6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":897987,"name":"Framed Art Print, 'The Bear Dance' by William Beard: Outer Size 40 x 28\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":248.87,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dzVyM1bHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CUSTOM ARTWORK DETAILS: TITLE: The Bear Dance; ARTIST: William Beard. ARTIST BIO: William Beard was elected an Associate member of the National Academy of Design in 1861, and a full member in 1862. He is regarded as a better artist than his brother, James Beard, but both were successful during their lifetimes. DESCRIPTION: With The Bear Dance by William Beard, invite an air of playful joy to your wall with this charming classic framed art print.. OUTER SIZE: 39 in. W x 28 in. H. 100% REAL WOOD FRAME DETAILS: The Cyprus Walnut Narrow frame features an angled frame with a slightly lifted outer ridge. The finish is a rich walnut color with fine grain lines and darker edges. This Amanti Art framed art print was created by William Beard and printed by Amanti Art in Madison WI. The print is giclee printed using fade-resistant inks for picture-perfect detail and incredible depth of color and finished with a 100% real wood frame. Individually made using traditional custom framing techniques, it has the quality you would expect from your local frame shop. Because of our attention to detail and focus on artistry, architects, interior designers, and homeowners alike choose this framed art print to create beautiful living spaces.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dzVyM1bHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amanti Art","source_asin":"B0B193KY8N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-897987","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B193KY8N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B193KY8N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
